ty record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February, August to September, September to October and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 years. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 51% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 28650 had its driest year in 1976 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
